### Putting things together

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\dfrac{dy}{dx}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{d}{dx}\left(\sqrt{e^x}\right)
\\\\
&=\dfrac{d}{dx}\left[v\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\right]&&\gray{\text{Let }u(x)=e^x\text{, }v(x)=\sqrt x}
\\\\
&=v'\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\cdot u'(x)&&\gray{\text{The chain rule}}
\\\\
&=\blueD{\dfrac{1}{2\sqrt{e^x}}}\cdot \maroonC{e^x}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{\sqrt{e^x}}{2}
\end{align}$
